  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「タビビトノキ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BF%E3%83%93%E3%83%93%E3%83%88%E3%83%8E%E3%82%AD",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 101366986,
      "text": "タビビトノキ は、マダガスカル原産のバナナに似た植物である。標準和名はオウギバショウ（扇芭蕉）。オオギバショウや、旅人木（りょじんぼく）ともいう。英語名は\"Traveller's Palm（旅人のヤシ）\"だが、ヤシ目ヤシ科ではなくショウガ目ゴクラクチョウカ科に属する。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Ravenala madagascariensis」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravenala_madagascariensis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1375543275,
      "text": "Ravenala madagascariensis, commonly known as the traveller's tree, fan palm, traveller's palm or East-West palm, is a species of monocotyledonous flowering plant found in Madagascar. It is not a true palm but a member of the family Strelitziaceae. In tropical and subtropical regions, the plant is widely cultivated for its distinctive habit and foliage."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "cultivation": {
      "ja": {
        "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「タビビトノキ」の節「栽培」",
        "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BF%E3%83%93%E3%83%93%E3%83%88%E3%83%8E%E3%82%AD#%E6%A0%BD%E5%9F%B9",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 101366986,
        "heading": "栽培",
        "text": "日当たりのよい場所を好むが、大きくなるまでは日光を当てすぎない方がよい。生育期に窒素肥料を与えるとよく育ち、葉もよく茂る。樹高は平均で7メートルほどに達する。適度な水分の供給が必要である。",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Ravenala madagascariensis」の節「Cultivation」",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravenala_madagascariensis#Cultivation",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1375543275,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "The plant requires a sunny spot (not full sun until it is larger). It responds well to fertilizer, especially if it is high in nitrogen during the growing season. This produces better growth and foliage. The plant grows to an average height of 7 m (23 ft) and requires moderate water.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
